WEBVTT

00:14:29.236 --> 00:14:31.676
And connecting it all
to the rest of the city

00:14:31.716 --> 00:14:34.316
via a clean public transport.

00:14:34.996 --> 00:14:38.476
The latest Norwegian national survey

00:14:38.516 --> 00:14:42.036
showed that 37 percent

00:14:42.036 --> 00:14:46.476
of all daily trips in Oslo
are done by walking.

00:14:46.876 --> 00:14:50.916
So, despite our very long and cold winter,

00:14:50.916 --> 00:14:54.516
we have become a city of walkers.

00:14:55.196 --> 00:14:56.676
And increasingly,

00:14:56.676 --> 00:14:59.396
if you walk past
a construction site in Oslo,

00:14:59.436 --> 00:15:01.476
you will hear no noise.